                "description": "The Emtek Modern Double Cylinder Deadbolt offers the sleek designs of modern door hardware without the sharp corners. This round double cylinder deadbolt has a contemporary silhouette that makes it a great choice for renovations. Emtek's Contemporary Door Lock is available in several beautiful finishes. It is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a double cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a key from both the interior and the exterior.",
